msgid "30M卡在一套板上用过段时间，还可以放到別的板上用吗？(不超月限量）"
msgstr ""
"After a 30MB SIM card has been used on one board for a period of time, "
"can it still be used on another board? (Provided the monthly limit is not"
" exceeded.)"

#: 8d2a3956e4c04c24a119ca951c3ef6c1
