#: 9eae6628b3dd48eba3c6c534d3166da3
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:41
msgid "A9模组可以用来开发维码器吗？"
msgstr "Can the A9 module be used to develop a QR-code device?"

#: 2afeed25612c4f8fad1719dab29cf209
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:42
msgid "可以，只要能联网都可以，不过服务器您自己要去开发，以及它们之间的信息传输"
msgstr ""
"Yes, as long as it can connect to the network. However, you need to "
"develop the server yourself, as well as the information transmission "
"between them."

#: 33bf1308b206496497438be57f1bccaf
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:45
msgid "有没有2G模块，带有天线座子的？"
