#: 45753841c2d9407d88aa6115855699b7
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:49
msgid "A9G室内定位效果怎么样"
msgstr "How is the indoor positioning performance of A9G?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:50
#: bcf69a736fff4e2a981eb85b37d54ddd
msgid "不支持室内定位哦"
msgstr "Indoor positioning is not supported."

#: 952db66f3ff448579379aa5363efc04a
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:53
msgid "A9G开发板可以支持tcp链接吗"
msgstr "Does the A9G development board support TCP connections?"

#: 9eec0b35f0e34f87bbe09c302282b70a
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:57
msgid "A9G，这个可以支持透传云吗"
msgstr "Does A9G support transparent transmission cloud?"

#: 8e4984affe4f44b8803ddcc7fc55f128
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:58
msgid "支持透传云"
msgstr "Yes, transparent transmission cloud is supported."

#: 981e8eb6c2a249d68c31a66409b36555
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:61
msgid "2G模块的传输速率大概是多少啊"
msgstr "What is the approximate transmission rate of the 2G module?"

#: 6e2cd5d3b25c4b8c99f8cc62d46c8834
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:62
msgid "下载 85.6Kbps，上传 42.8Kbps；"
msgstr "Download: 85.6Kbps; upload: 42.8Kbps."

#: 41fb135d1c8c4ec98503ad28bff7df3e
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:65
msgid "BG01-T 需要驱动吗"
msgstr "Does BG01-T require a driver?"

#: 93160c8b1fc64cbcb3cd5d30d4ecfc66
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:66
msgid "上电就能用"
msgstr "It can be used after power-on."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:69
#: b0659c3b580f40179b3a81455f83841a
msgid "A9G请问能在51单片机上用吗？ 手机端能以地图形式实时定位嘛？"
msgstr ""
"Can A9G be used with a 51 MCU? Can the mobile app display real-time "
"positioning in map form?"

#: 55d041e9c04f4933ae950061e86cf7e8
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:70
msgid "只要能串口通讯就可以在51单片机上使用 ，可以定位"
msgstr ""
"As long as serial communication is possible, it can be used with a 51 "
"MCU. Positioning is supported."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:73
#: a8b48fc86c3e41649ff7ba46cc3db57d
msgid "A9G的二维码字符串怎么获取"
msgstr "How can I obtain the QR-code string of A9G?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:74
#: e1a45a381b0e490ea212d1135343c31b
msgid "生成二维码后生成二维码字符串"
msgstr "After generating the QR code, the QR-code string is generated."

#: 30c698efbe0e4dc1b728d43b3450cd97
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:77
msgid "A9G开发板能用arduinoide吗 ？怎么编程"
msgstr "Can the A9G development board be used with Arduino? How is it programmed?"

#: 97afb19d3fa54a8bb051e2da3d1d507f
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:78
msgid "不能。用SDK进行开发"
msgstr "No. It is developed using the SDK."

#: 3c91a6b580ea4229b7483b6886889cb7
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:81
msgid "A9G模块  跑什么操作系统的？"
msgstr "What operating system does the A9G module run?"

#: 5ae648462c144cdc8e4f743a7d1ee2d4
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:82
msgid "裸机"
msgstr "Bare-metal."

#: 1344671ec7d549ad878042ca5cc756b3
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:85
msgid "A9G 支持lua ? A9G  与A9 有些什么区别呢？支持USB么"
msgstr ""
"Does A9G support Lua? What are the differences between A9G and A9? Does "
"it support USB?"

#: 5fccd48ff7c049b997479425cbd8066e
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:86
msgid "不支持lua，不支持USB ，USB是用来供电的，A9G多了一个GPS功能"
msgstr ""
"Lua is not supported. USB is not supported; USB is used for power supply."
" A9G adds GPS functionality compared with A9."

#: 8fb897a1d4e040fc954d57657e213352
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:89
msgid "A9G跑的是什么协议栈"
msgstr "What protocol stack does A9G run?"

#: 535d4293579e4bad90befb8f40743b67
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:90
msgid "GSM"
msgstr "GSM."

#: 646086802d7e4238ada0a32fd3d6b2cf
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:93
msgid "A9模块在国外能使用吗？"
msgstr "Can the A9 module be used overseas?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:94
#: bc82b923dbf84696b5ee8c49f45a3a5e
msgid "\"亲，这个不确定，因为通信频段可能不一样，这个需要配合物联网卡使用"
msgstr ""
"It is uncertain because communication frequency bands may differ. It "
"needs to be used with an IoT SIM card."

#: 875ae0b67c1f4678a578280a11d5006e
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:97
msgid "A9芯片回来我直接用吗？不用再下固件了吧。 那我直接发指令就可以控制是吧？通过单片机串口"
msgstr ""
"After receiving the A9 chip, can I use it directly? Do I need to download"
" firmware again? Can I control it directly by sending commands through "
"the MCU serial port?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:98
#: a7bb09b00d844546bcb660f1a2fc2fa8
msgid "不用在下固件。是的，直接控制"
msgstr "No need to download firmware again. Yes, it can be controlled directly."

#: 7bfc221149a4496582be74eadaa098f4
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:101
msgid "\"机智云是不是不支持A9G模块了？"
msgstr "Does Gizwits no longer support the A9G module?"

#: 37b0c989327d4fb1bbebd82810a75a53
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:102
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:457
#: c830b8c827004c509aa8277f6d3d77cb
msgid "支持的"
msgstr "It is supported."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:105
#: c7de1cdd3eec45ef933ab7266b6ce942
msgid "A9G的开发板那个gps数据是从串口2读取吧？"
msgstr "Is the GPS data of the A9G development board read from UART2?"

#: 3fc0056a254543bfaa5fe9bd5c1f640d 6a489d7a020544afa8f2566eb37b8855
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:106
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:291
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:366
#: bfbf2a45f6714a9c8ecd5c59590e56eb
msgid "是的"
msgstr "Yes."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:109
#: f3a3c088d1b54cd59a74e8d65710424f
msgid "A9G开发板使用需要哪些东西？"
msgstr "What is needed to use the A9G development board?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:110
#: d14f491b5d7f4f3895b9cb12d175bb7e
msgid "开发板+CP2102.电源用电脑的USB口就可以供电,CP2102就是拿来供电还有调试的"
msgstr ""
"Development board + CP2102. The computer USB port can be used for power "
"supply. CP2102 is used for both power supply and debugging."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:113
#: c5748843b93d4754a843fa7e61d27477
msgid ""
"A9G模组的 GPRS, GPS是可以同时工作的么? 另外, 我看你们官网关于A9G模组说明里面有HTTPGET方法暂不支持(下一版本支持), "
"那现在HTTPGET方法支持了么?"
msgstr ""
"Can GPRS and GPS of the A9G module work at the same time? Also, I saw on "
"your official website that the HTTPGET method for A9G is temporarily "
"unsupported and will be supported in the next version. Is HTTPGET "
"supported now?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:114
#: eae35148bbb741e9b0608922be0811eb
msgid "亲，是支持的哦，A9G可以get"
msgstr "Yes, it is supported. A9G can perform GET."

#: 31b54ac277534d8e98a24a22187ff4ac
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:117
msgid "请问A9模块串口能兼容5V电平吗？"
msgstr "Is the serial port of the A9 module compatible with 5V levels?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:119
#: bb9f9af677df45128d863729dfbef62b
msgid "不能兼容5V电平，A9供电要5V电源，电流要2A以上"
msgstr ""
"It is not compatible with 5V levels. A9 requires a 5V power supply, and "
"the current should be above 2A."

#: 797faacbd73b43de81e3e01278eecbb8
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:122
msgid "A9G支持MQTT吗？"
msgstr "Does A9G support MQTT?"

#: 6598d483a7a9403ba6d99bd50fba0a12
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:124
msgid "支持的，需要您二次开发哦"
msgstr "Yes, but you need to perform secondary development."

#: 516778e625d34c5da645c68e293dadcd
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:127
msgid "gprs如何获取模组二维码字符串"
msgstr "How does GPRS obtain the module QR-code string?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:128
#: a6b29d21b7064bee9d44ad15730801be
msgid "通过发送AT指令"
msgstr "By sending AT commands."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:131
#: e920c3a9d6c44d8ca2d2fa1b43f6388a
msgid "A9G开发板这个怎么开发 ？怎么实时发送温度到微信公众号？"
msgstr ""
"How do I develop with the A9G development board? How can I send "
"temperature to a WeChat official account in real time?"

#: 7781515ae7a7409790c7715b037bd11b
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:132
msgid "可以进行开发，通过SDK"
msgstr "Development can be done through the SDK."

#: 7bab601917da4b1a8518c083326c70c2
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:135
msgid "请问a9模块必须与机智云软件结合起开使用吗？a9模块能与stm32f1系列开发版结合使用吗？"
msgstr ""
"Must the A9 module be used together with Gizwits software? Can the A9 "
"module be used with STM32F1 series development boards?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:139
#: c6fc24526b604cb5b0c6683e1c5f7c8c
msgid "GP-01，GP-02，BG01-T，BG02-T这些定位器是需要后期开发还是直接可以用？ 手机上可以看定位吗"
msgstr ""
"Do GP-01, GP-02, BG01-T, and BG02-T locators require later development, "
"or can they be used directly? Can positioning be viewed on a mobile "
"phone?"

#: 60736c75730b4b9e9717b3e4cc97e20d
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:140
msgid "直接可以使用 ，手机上看不了哦，是通过串口打印定位信息的"
msgstr ""
"They can be used directly. However, positioning cannot be viewed on a "
"mobile phone; positioning information is printed through the serial port."

#: 2d5ce5676ffc4e73b19ac8974896bf7a
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:143
msgid "A9G支持MQTT的at命令吗？"
msgstr "Does A9G support MQTT AT commands?"

#: 068bcc0b69ed4b6ebe14312ceac594cd 30ab47c78b8d43918d129aafb3b3c9cb
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:144
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:326
msgid "支持MQTT"
msgstr "MQTT is supported."

#: 77ab15dc67ac41848e56f1eeca742410
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:147
msgid "A9开发板支持wifi吗？"
msgstr "Does the A9 development board support Wi-Fi?"

#: 39801ee811a0470dbff171ddb4134749
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:148
msgid "A9是2G模块，不走WI-FI协议"
msgstr "A9 is a 2G module and does not use the Wi-Fi protocol."

#: 8731b429d46c4a78977d1458739aeddd
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:151
msgid "A9Tracker这个软件手机打不开啊"
msgstr "The A9Tracker software cannot be opened on the phone."

#: 17e41db252e84f918c73e5a092724647
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:153
msgid "这个是软件和手机版本不兼容的原因，目前这边已经在进行更新，后续会有一个新的APP"
msgstr ""
"This is due to incompatibility between the software and the phone "
"version. We are currently updating it, and a new app will be released "
"later."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:156
#: ec0d7f71ed5a4c66be57b25b638d1fc9
msgid "A9G能通过一个串口读取GPS信息和进行AT控制吗？ 只能通过两个串口吗？ 两个串口分别是哪两个？能二次开发吗"
msgstr ""
"Can A9G read GPS information and perform AT control through one serial "
"port? Must two serial ports be used? Which serial ports are they? Can it "
"be secondarily developed?"

#: 9b15b540a141467191d32488e62f27ef
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:157
msgid "不可以哦 ，只能通过两个串口。一个是AT串口  一个是下载串口  一个是GPS串口，下载串口只是做下载使用，可以二次开发"
msgstr ""
"No. It can only be done through two serial ports. One is the AT serial "
"port, one is the download serial port, and one is the GPS serial port. "
"The download serial port is only for downloading. Secondary development "
"is supported."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:160
#: cc5375fc358a48c5bd3fd54e72f8f00b
msgid "A9开发板供电可以极限是5.5V吗？5.28会有问题吗"
msgstr ""
"Is the maximum power supply limit of the A9 development board 5.5V? Will "
"5.28V cause problems?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:161
#: ba10df42ba214ff885e58791c0541ae9
msgid "5V。应该会有哦，因为模块供电范围是3.8V-4.2V，USB是做了降压电路处理"
msgstr ""
"5V. It may cause problems because the module power supply range is 3.8V "
"to 4.2V. The USB port has a step-down circuit."

#: 8dd05725e82c417ca6a308f3d935c80e
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:164
msgid "A9G开发板可以刷NodeMCU 吗"
msgstr "Can the A9G development board flash NodeMCU?"

#: 4224dcd5374546a1ad71d26dfe0244de 59d6d5a126aa48eb9e0934fe8c4a93df
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:166
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:254
msgid "不行哦"
msgstr "No."

#: 39e3ef27a9e848d9af233cd15b0f3754
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:169
msgid "A9G模块能和3.3v的单片机直接相连吗？"
msgstr "Can the A9G module be directly connected to a 3.3V MCU?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:171
#: d6a11c09694a4851bebcb4a342039a15
