msgstr "What is USB 1.1 on the A9G development board used for?"

#: 479f547b88964067943f3d7ebf501de0
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:578
msgid "供电"
msgstr "Power supply."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:581
#: a0c3d363af5b4ad19112562a4735b9d0
msgid "A9G开发板GPS定位支持北斗定位吗？GPRS和GPS功能切换都能通过AT指令实现吗"
msgstr ""
"Does the A9G development board GPS positioning support BeiDou? Can GPRS "
"and GPS function switching be implemented through AT commands?"

#: 8bba14062011499eb079181f21cc30dd
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:582
msgid "支持，能通过AT指令实现"
msgstr ""
"Yes, BeiDou is supported, and switching can be implemented through AT "
"commands."

#: 53df528e1b5b4bb7b35ce0857cfeda32
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:585
msgid "A9G开发板发送MQTT消息报文最长是多少啊"
msgstr ""
"What is the maximum length of an MQTT message packet sent by the A9G "
"development board?"

#: 7f16da06e3374ce599e1b9c332fe9870
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:586
msgid "256"
msgstr "256."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:589
#: e50444d000364295ab5d3192ea4f1399
msgid "A9G用5v供电可以吗？"
msgstr "Can A9G be powered by 5V?"

#: 06d9694578c34a87a7d00d92922a1ac2
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:593
msgid "A9G可以将IO口检测到开关状态传送出去吗？"
msgstr "Can A9G transmit the switch state detected by an IO pin?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:594
#: d6bf932c12e948c19a9192076b847056
msgid "需要二次开发"
msgstr "Secondary development is required."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:597
#: e0e42d38e57241889be7973a23824cc1
msgid "A9G连接机智云出现ERROR:50该如何处理？"
msgstr "How to handle ERROR:50 when A9G connects to Gizwits?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:598
#: db23c283ffbf41789a8f24e43f7e9789
msgid "先发送AT+CGATT=0分离上一次的附着，在发送AT+CGATT=1，AT+CGDCONT=1,\"IP\",\"CMNET\"，AT+CGACT=1,1三条指令重新入网"
msgstr ""
"First send AT+CGATT=0 to detach from the previous attachment, then send "
"AT+CGATT=1, AT+CGDCONT=1,\"IP\",\"CMNET\", and AT+CGACT=1,1 to re-"
"register on the network."

#: 2371a15133544cfb842871f3fbde1f8b
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:601
msgid "A9G模块为何获取不到定位数据？"
msgstr "Why can’t the A9G module obtain positioning data?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:602
#: b5fe2fc44d1c499d969f39a461fdd6da
msgid "单模组情况，考虑匹配的天线有问题。"
msgstr ""
"For a standalone module, consider whether there is a problem with the "
"matched antenna."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:605
#: de54272addc741f8becbd6def8ff592e
msgid "A9G断电后重新上电无法联网导致机智云失败，该如何解决"
msgstr ""
"How to solve Gizwits failure caused by A9G being unable to reconnect to "
"the network after power-off and power-on?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:606
#: e6cd1d063c70489b873fc79760a93e8e
msgid "先发送AT+CGATT=0分离上一次的网络附着，后面重新发送AT+CGATT=1，AT+CGDCONT=1,\"IP\",\"CMNET\"，AT+CGACT=1,1重新附着网络即可"
msgstr ""
"First send AT+CGATT=0 to detach from the previous network attachment, "
"then send AT+CGATT=1, AT+CGDCONT=1,\"IP\",\"CMNET\", and AT+CGACT=1,1 to "
"attach to the network again."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:609
#: d198d6cd60c140b1b7015d55f4ad296c
msgid "A9G打电话的时候接话筒声音小该如何解决"
msgstr "How to solve low microphone/receiver volume during calls on A9G?"

#: 2a6e092b007843278232af97feaba2aa
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:610
msgid "尝试发送AT+CRSL=15设置一下通话音量的等级。"
msgstr "Try sending AT+CRSL=15 to set the call volume level."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:613
#: eddff9285cc344e3a545247ffff85bcb
msgid "哪些模组支持基站定位"
msgstr "Which modules support base-station positioning?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:614
#: daf0073bd34f43dc974dc440ace8a853
msgid "A9G模组和4GCat.1模块"
msgstr "A9G module and 4G Cat.1 modules."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:617
#: a479f2cbd6a9431299173735495d645f
msgid "A9G开发板为何短信与通话服务正常，唯独联网功能异常？"
msgstr ""
"Why are SMS and call services normal on the A9G development board, but "
"networking is abnormal?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:618
#: c8b6738c891a4dd7ac0c5b4233a0b70d
msgid "仅仅联网功能异常的情况，怀疑卡流量已用完，需向营业厅服务专员确认。"
msgstr ""
"If only the networking function is abnormal, the SIM card data may have "
"been used up. Please confirm with the carrier service staff."

#: 0dd5b4a520eb47099a24ba997845791b
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:621
msgid "A9G实现不了你们公众号的定位功能怎么办？"
msgstr ""
"What should I do if A9G can no longer implement the positioning function "
"from your WeChat official account?"

#: 08e199e65ca34a008cb7bcf73a7ab8a7
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:622
msgid "该功能已没有维护了，因此若是要实现定位功能，建议通过MQTT协议连接阿里的定位功能。详情参考我们EC-01G连接阿里云地图实现定位的文档。"
msgstr ""
"This function is no longer maintained. Therefore, if you need positioning"
" functionality, it is recommended to connect to Alibaba's positioning "
"function through the MQTT protocol. For details, refer to our document on"
" EC-01G connecting to Alibaba Cloud Map for positioning."

#: 43d1c77b253d4422b87292b5f6362d10
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:625
msgid "A9G如何发送中文短信，需要做哪些操作"
msgstr "How does A9G send Chinese SMS messages, and what operations are required?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:626
#: b3e2ecdda80b4bf28ada68b7e02c2daa
msgid "需要使用PDU工具将中文进行编码"
msgstr "You need to use a PDU tool to encode Chinese characters."

#: 0c08290acb0e44a789faaffe4842bae1
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:629
msgid "A9模块支持TTS吗"
msgstr "Does the A9 module support TTS?"

#: 7634fc36e75d41a182e195a440979e9b
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:630
msgid "不支持，模块仅支持打电话功能"
msgstr "No. The module only supports phone-call functionality."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:633
#: bf24557ae8ce42c697e1f0d8c012c7d3
msgid "请问一下A9可以播放TF卡里面的音乐么？"
msgstr "Can A9 play music from a TF card?"

#: 99630a87907f44bb91ad23bc95d7034a
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:634
msgid "不支持；"
msgstr "No."

#: 87fdb997da0b4cf9a0becde34f67efef
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:637
msgid "请问一下A9G微信定位功能为何没用呢？"
msgstr "Why doesn’t the A9G WeChat positioning function work?"

#: 000b4deed249477ba4d506ddfbaea6c5
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:638
msgid "当前GPS功能服务器已经不维护了，若是要实现GPS可视化功能，要自行去找别的服务器（比如阿里云定位功能），实现实时定位功能。"
msgstr ""
"The current GPS function server is no longer maintained. If you want GPS "
"visualization, you need to find another server yourself, such as Alibaba "
"Cloud positioning, to implement real-time positioning."

#: 6529a642aba64c6a9343c45ef621e638
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:641
msgid "请问一下A9G模块或者EC-01G模块能否通过短信将GPS数据传输出去？"
msgstr "Can the A9G module or EC-01G module transmit GPS data by SMS?"

#: 24fc5e34e9804f578ffb063fe881ccb7
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:642
msgid "A9G模块可以实现；EC-01G不能实现，该模组没有发送短信的功能；"
msgstr ""
"The A9G module can implement this. EC-01G cannot, because it does not "
"have SMS-sending functionality."

#: 00be54206e264dd0b110dad152cf1295
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:645
msgid "A9G模块出现+CME ERROR:148 该如何排查"
msgstr "How to troubleshoot +CME ERROR:148 on the A9G module?"

#: 2e1559fe9e48454b916887e632f39d21
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:646
msgid "请检查SIM卡是否出现锁卡或者无流量的情况"
msgstr "Please check whether the SIM card is locked or has no data remaining."

#: 704382e2e55c4eb8a5767675500d0b42
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:649
msgid "A9G开发板可以增加IO输入输出功能吗"
msgstr "Can the A9G development board add IO input/output functionality?"

#: 39f6b31d55114c7fbdef76e527f396c5
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:650
msgid "可以，通过SDK开发实现"
msgstr "Yes, it can be implemented through SDK development."

#: 39a8b7826c8f43dc8298c792daebf7d4
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:653
msgid "A9开发板支持lua开发吗"
msgstr "Does the A9 development board support Lua development?"

#: 736b1d77452c412196ec5c8658be1960
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:654
msgid "不支持，如需开发可以下载C SDK"
msgstr "No. If development is required, you can download the C SDK."

#: 7564d9fd21544286bc329bdb21db6291
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:658
msgid "A9G模块是如何传输数据的"
msgstr "How does the A9G module transmit data?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:659
#: dba24fc634ed4506b894224c708cea39
msgid "通过物联网卡或者移动2G进行无线传输"
msgstr "It transmits wirelessly through an IoT SIM card or China Mobile 2G."

#: 5fcc54e7c4ee4778bb958996d86b9b79
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:662
msgid "A9G支持主动打电话功能吗"
msgstr "Does A9G support active phone dialing?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:663
#: feb7f83c07ed456dbfe73bb0cb3a0294
msgid "支持，通过串口发送指令实现，有相关的AT示例"
msgstr ""
"Yes. It can be implemented by sending commands through the serial port, "
