#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:666
#: e60532e3f0ce4241827278e13a1f9b59
msgid "A9G可以测量经纬度和海拔高度吗"
msgstr "Can A9G measure longitude, latitude, and altitude?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:667
#: ee86cbff38c94edea0f4a7f2df21a15b
msgid "可以测试，通过串口发送GPS相关指令解析相关参数"
msgstr ""
"Yes. Send GPS-related commands through the serial port and parse the "
"relevant parameters."

#: 65c54cde49234dec94cda5f5f263d5b6
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:670
msgid "A9G开发板要插sd卡还是要插sim卡"
msgstr ""
"Should the A9G development board be inserted with an SD card or a SIM "
"card?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/GPRS/index.rst:671
#: bf6509f1d0e64dad8649b80624d8a805
msgid "开发板使用AT功能只需插sim卡即可，如需做SD卡读写功能则需要再插上sd卡进行调试"
msgstr ""
"For using AT functions, only a SIM card is required. If SD card "
"read/write functionality is needed, then insert an SD card for debugging."

